PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'jewish_cooperation');
!}

= Cooperation with Jewish Organisations

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration costs this month's action; it changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @broad
- @labour_only
- @none
- @easy_discard

@broad
title: Broad cooperation and rights in the programme
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_broad_present = 1 : This is the present line. Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_broad_present = 0 : Agreements on rights and joint actions; axis +2. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'jewish_cooperation', 'broad').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_broad_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'jewish_cooperation', 'broad');
!}
go-to: result

